            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Tamil for tennis, then the Tamil for kabaddi."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: குத்துச்சண்டை",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "குத்துச்சண்டை — kuttuccaṇṭai — \"boxing\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "அவன் குத்துச்சண்டையில் முதல் பரிசு வென்றான். avaṉ kuttuccaṇṭaiyil mutal paricu veṉṟāṉ. He won first prize in boxing."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Word for word \"punch-fight\": குத்து \"a punch\" + சண்டை \"a fight\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "குத்துச்சண்டை (kuttuccaṇṭai) is a compound of the native குத்து (kuttu), \"to pierce, a thrust\" (DEDR 1719), and சண்டை (caṇṭai), \"a fight\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
